flowchart LR

    USER[Schwab User]

    IDP[Enterprise Identity Provider<br/>SAML SSO]

    XAPI[Cloud Journey Experience API / Backend]

    AUTHZ[Cloud Journey Authorizer]

    AGENT[Cloud Journey Agent Runtime]

    GW[Agent Gateway]

    MCP[Custom MCP Server]

    USER -->|SAML Authentication| IDP

    IDP -->|SAML Assertion| XAPI

    XAPI --> AUTHZ

    AUTHZ -->|Authenticated User Context| AGENT

    AGENT -->|Agent Identity + User Context| GW

    GW --> MCP
